flowchart TB
    config[Config, realm and PKI] --> runtime[TheNodes runtime]

    cal[CAL application] <--> api[Public API]
    plugins[NEP plugins] <--> host[PluginContext and PluginManager]
    api --> delivery[Delivery runtime<br/>reliability, deduplication and ordering]
    host --> delivery

    delivery --> policy[Connection policy]
    policy <--> state[PeerManager and PeerStore<br/>peers, routes and health]

    policy --> tcp[TCP<br/>TLS, Noise or plaintext]
    policy --> udp[UDP + Noise<br/>NAT traversal]
    policy --> relay[Relay<br/>store and forward]

    tcp <--> peers[Remote peers]
    udp <--> peers
    relay <--> peers

    tcp --> inbound[Inbound validation,<br/>deduplication and ordering]
    udp --> inbound
    relay --> inbound
    inbound --> host

    runtime -. structured events .-> events[Event dispatcher]
    delivery -. structured events .-> events
    state -. structured events .-> events
    events --> sinks[Console, JSONL and plugin sinks]